Package: cdlsim
Title: Simulation of Cropland Data Layer Products from the USDA
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Haley", "Burger", , "A02425259@usu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides tools to simulate categorical raster data, including
    objects from the 'terra' package. Functions focus on generating edge pixel
    values from reclassified raster data derived from the United States
    Department of Agriculture (USDA) Cropland Data Layer products.
